# iot/include

Project headers shared by the firmware sources:

- `parking_config.h` — pin map, timings, role/device constants (both gate roles).
- `parking_secrets.example.h` — template for Wi-Fi credentials, API base URL
  and device tokens.

Create your private config once:

```powershell
Copy-Item parking_secrets.example.h parking_secrets.h
```

`parking_secrets.h` is git-ignored; `parking_config.h` automatically includes
it when present and falls back to safe development defaults otherwise.
